stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> pending : Package awarded & milestone created

  pending --> in_progress : Assigned contractor starts work (secured RPC)

  in_progress --> submitted_for_review : Contractor logs 100% progress & uploads photos

  submitted_for_review --> approved : Project owner or admin approves (secured RPC)
  submitted_for_review --> rework_required : Project owner or admin enters rework notes (secured RPC)

  rework_required --> in_progress : Contractor resumes work to rectify defects

  approved --> [*] : Milestone completed
